    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Levers</strong> to pull, <strong>buttons</strong> to press, <strong>crates</strong> to move\u2014accompanied by the steady rhythm of clicking gears. This ancient, decaying temple holds <strong>secrets waiting to be uncovered.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907800/extras/be64622b38f9592f52163ca499ed9301.poster.avif?t=1745341318\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907800/extras/be64622b38f9592f52163ca499ed9301.webm?t=1745341318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907800/extras/be64622b38f9592f52163ca499ed9301.mp4?t=1745341318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER THE TRUTH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been sent here with little context\u2014just a <strong>vague objective: retrieve something.</strong> But this place is <strong>stranger</strong> and <strong>larger</strong> than it seems. <strong>Will you be able to find every secrets?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Trapped in a maze inside a labyrinth inside a maze inside a labyrinth inside a maze inside a labyrinth...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907800/extras/6e7fc61b867489ec3c396619f1bef6a6.poster.avif?t=1745341318\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907800/extras/6e7fc61b867489ec3c396619f1bef6a6.webm?t=1745341318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907800/extras/6e7fc61b867489ec3c396619f1bef6a6.mp4?t=1745341318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CONUNDRUM: HELIX</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full remake of <i>Conundrum</i> by <strong>Nogam</strong>, <strong><i>The Conundrum: Helix</i></strong> brings new life to the original short experience through reimagined puzzles, deeper lore, and an enhanced sense of mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>The Witness</i>, <i>Animal Well</i>, and <i>Portal</i>, this is a compact adventure where every solved challenge pulls you deeper into the <strong>never ending temple</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New puzzle mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced visuals and sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved voice acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reworked and expanded puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brand new secrets and content exclusive to this version</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Levers</strong> to pull, <strong>buttons</strong> to press, <strong>crates</strong> to move\u2014accompanied by the steady rhythm of clicking gears. This ancient, decaying temple holds <strong>secrets waiting to be uncovered.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907800/extras/be64622b38f9592f52163ca499ed9301.poster.avif?t=1745341318\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907800/extras/be64622b38f9592f52163ca499ed9301.webm?t=1745341318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907800/extras/be64622b38f9592f52163ca499ed9301.mp4?t=1745341318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DISCOVER THE TRUTH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been sent here with little context\u2014just a <strong>vague objective: retrieve something.</strong> But this place is <strong>stranger</strong> and <strong>larger</strong> than it seems. <strong>Will you be able to find every secrets?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Trapped in a maze inside a labyrinth inside a maze inside a labyrinth inside a maze inside a labyrinth...&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907800/extras/6e7fc61b867489ec3c396619f1bef6a6.poster.avif?t=1745341318\" width=800 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907800/extras/6e7fc61b867489ec3c396619f1bef6a6.webm?t=1745341318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2907800/extras/6e7fc61b867489ec3c396619f1bef6a6.mp4?t=1745341318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE CONUNDRUM: HELIX</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A full remake of <i>Conundrum</i> by <strong>Nogam</strong>, <strong><i>The Conundrum: Helix</i></strong> brings new life to the original short experience through reimagined puzzles, deeper lore, and an enhanced sense of mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by <i>The Witness</i>, <i>Animal Well</i>, and <i>Portal</i>, this is a compact adventure where every solved challenge pulls you deeper into the <strong>never ending temple</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New puzzle mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced visuals and sound design</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improved voice acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reworked and expanded puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brand new secrets and content exclusive to this version</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Amid the echoing clatter of gears and forgotten machines, explore a mysterious temple filled with intricate puzzles A short yet immersive first-person puzzle-platformer where every mechanism reveals a deeper mystery.",
